 "description": "The Saffier SE 38 Leader is the newest member of the Saffier Yachts Elegance line. Designed for owners who value the pure daysailing experience of a Saffier Yachts daysailer but want to take a meaningful step forward in onboard comfort, the Saffier SE 38 Leader offers a rare blend of elegance, performance and true live-aboard luxury.\nOn the outside she is clearly a Saffier Yachts: sleek, modern and built for speed. On the inside she redefines what comfort means.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "D. Hennevanger | K. Van de Stadt"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Comfort, Storage and Luxury Sunbathing",
   "intro": "The closed transom of the Saffier SE 38 Leader creates a versatile and comfortable deck layout. The aft section offers large integrated storage, while a full-size sun lounge lets you relax at anchor, underway, or in the marina.\nAn integrated folding swimming platform provides direct access to the liferaft storage compartment. Overall, the deck layout combines comfort, ample storage, and enjoyable time on board.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Comfort Redefined Below Deck",
   "intro": "Step inside the Saffier SE 38 Leader, where onboard comfort reaches a new level.\nWarm materials, soft curves and generous natural light create a welcoming retreat for longer weekends or comfortable cruising with family and friends. Every element below deck is designed to feel comfortable and calm. Exactly what you want after a sporty day out on the water.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Effortless Sailing, single-handed perfection",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 38 Leader is created for sailors who want the freedom to sail with complete independence.\nEvery line, every winch and every control is positioned for perfect single-handed operation, allowing one person to manage the yacht by himself without any compromise on performance. Her balanced hull and refined underwater profile deliver a calm and stable sailing experience, while the intuitive deck layout ensures that hoisting, trimming and furling are performed from the helm without leaving your seat. \n\nThis is single-handed sailing at its finest. Fast, safe, simple and beautifully efficient.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Performance with unmatched comfort",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 38 Leader features a reverse bow and a voluminous, performance-driven hull shape, ensuring impressive acceleration, excellent stability and effortless handling in all conditions.\nThe hull design has been refined in every detail to create a yacht that is very fast, stable and super easy to handle, ideal for both relaxed cruising and more energetic sailing.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Integrated liferaft",
   "intro": "Thanks to the closed transom, you can conveniently store your liferaft in the stern of the Saffier SE 38.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Retractable anchor system",
   "intro": "The bowsprit features an integrated retractable anchor system with an electric windlass for easy anchoring.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Customizable main bulkhead",
   "intro": "Adapt the interior style to your taste. Choose between an ultimate open feeling or a private owner’s suite in the bow.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Reversed bow",
   "intro": "Thanks to the new hull design with a reversed bow, sailing upwind and downwind is even faster.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  }
